ta":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The first girl that Riku speaks to. Has a positive and cheerful personality, no matter who it is she will always quickly become friendly with them. Not good at dealing with gratefulness, one word of thanks to her and she becomes numb. Although she lives a common life, her health has deteriorated to the condition of being hospitalized. She is in fact terminally ill, and does not have much time remaining. Has an obsessive love for apples."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c21362"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"街にやってきたばかりの陸が、最初に言葉を交わした少女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"朗らかで人当たりがよく、誰とでもすぐに仲良くなれる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"お礼を言われることが苦手で「ありがとう」の一言でもくすぐったくなってしまう。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"その身は病に侵されており、余命が残り少ない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"現在こそ普通に生活しているが、一度体調を大きく崩した場合は入院する、という約束をしている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"リンゴが大好物。中毒気味なくらい好き。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"4054","sourceWorkId":"20536","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"街にやってきたばかりの陸が、最初に言葉を交わした少女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"朗らかで人当たりがよく、誰とでもすぐに仲良くなれる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"お礼を言われることが苦手で、「ありがとう」 の一言でもくすぐったくなってしまう。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"その身は病に侵されており、余命が残り少ない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"現在こそ普通に生活しているが、一度体調を大きく崩した場合は入院する、という約束をしている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"リンゴが大好物。 中毒気味なくらい好き。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「なんとなーく分かるんだもん。 もう私、長くない――ってね。」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"26224"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a0/a088dbf871ae258679a71a06e47058c65d31274c2c4b25bb31d08cdbfe13c69f.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/3a/3a06b31c4932339de899ced54c595478238f6c912ec575bba8ebb72c4fb153d4.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"水野七海","creatorId":"vndb:s2524","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s2524","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s2524","name":"星野七海","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:105787:26224:17078:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c21363","characterName":"岩出山 未喜","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"26225","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"105787"}],"egsCharacterIds":["4055"],"vndbCharacterId":"c21363"},"originalCharacterName":"岩出山 未喜","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A girl that helps at her brother's curry shop. Petite and full of vitality. Although she has a childish side, but still is very reliable. She lost her parents when she was young and was raised by her brother. While she likes to dedicate herself to taking care of her brother, she worry that they will become not being able to be separated. Likes quizzes, will often suddenly give questions to people."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c21363"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"カレーショップ 『匙（さじ）』 で、経営者である兄の手伝いをしている少女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"小柄で、元気いっぱい。 子供っぽい面もあるが、基本的にしっかり者。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"幼い頃に両親がいなくなってしまい、兄に育てられた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"自分を大切にしてくれる兄のことを慕っている一方で、いつまでも妹離れしてくれないことを心配してもいる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"クイズが大好きで、仲のいい人には突然出題したりする。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"4055","sourceWorkId":"20536","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"カレーショップ 『匙（さじ）』 で、経営者である兄の手伝いをしている少女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"小柄で、元気いっぱい。 子供っぽい面もあるが、基本的にしっかり者。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"幼い頃に両親がいなくなってしまい、兄に育てられた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"自分を大切にしてくれる兄のことを慕っている一方で、いつまでも妹離れしてくれないことを心配してもいる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"クイズが大好きで、仲のいい人には突然出題したりする。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「陸くんは、誰かを本気で好きになったこと、ある？」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"26225"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b1/b1e72502c71d603870a212b70ecd6f3bac992c23e9eab04d41cf6a5ecc14550b.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/55/55c2cef4cc2a8844e8d1f5da57ff8600fb480bc6d10504e02b37339c5bd7ef1f.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"藤乃 理香","creatorId":"vndb:s945","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s945","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s945","name":"藤乃 理香","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:58923","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_c21364","characterName":"栗原 ゆめ","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"26226","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"105787"}],"egsCharacterIds":["4056"],"vndbCharacterId":"c21364"},"originalCharacterName":"栗原 ゆめ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A girl that Riku encountered on the streets, has an otaku atmosphere. Likes anime, manga and games, she also likes to secretly buy hentai doujins. A very shy girl, often cowers in front of people. But if she chatted about her favorite topics, then it becomes endless. Although she is a bit afraid of the protagonist, she tries very hard to talk to him. She seems to have an impression on the protagonist's clock."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c21364"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"街中で出会った少女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"結構なオタク。アニメ漫画ゲーム大好き。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"えっちな同人誌なんかも密かに買っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"内気で控えめ、少し引っ込み思案。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しかし好きなものの話になると、イキイキと語りだす。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"陸に対して、少しおどおどしながらも、頑張って話しかけようとしてくる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"どうやら陸の持つ『時計』に、見覚えがあるらしいが……？"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"4056","sourceWorkId":"20536","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"街中で出会った少女。 結構なオタク。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"アニメ・漫画・ゲーム大好き。 えっちな同人誌なんかも密かに買っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"内気で控えめ、少し引っ込み思案。 しかし好きなモノの話になると、活き活きと語りだす。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"陸に対して、少しおどおどしながらも、頑張って話し掛けようとしてくる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"どうやら陸の持つ “時計” に、見覚えがあるらしいが……？"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「陸さんは、時間が戻せたら何をしたいですか？」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"26226"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/3e/3ea225c300cf8b9f3f13e80ff1f9c5cbe801b19573d75848c5e3d50e987a4923.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/12/120df0dc9becf2ae6fbe6fbda3fcc05ce719b6e56fb218f270d1683c5a840cfb.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"花澤さくら","creatorId":"vndb:s947","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s947","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s947","name":"花澤 さくら","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:105787:26226:17075:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c21365","characterName":"瀬峰 藍里","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"26227","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"105787"}],"egsCharacterIds":["4057"],"vndbCharacterId":"c21365"},"originalCharacterName":"瀬峰 藍里","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A very strange girl that even her friend Shino seems to think so, nobody knows what she is thinking. She will suddenly moves into their faces and begin to utter nonsense. She has winning experiences in the national badminton assembly, and is well known in student athlete circles. Has a big appetite. Because she eats a lot, her chest is growing well."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c21365"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"親友の詩乃に言わせると「変わった子」で、何を考えてるかイマイチ分からない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"突然顔を近づけてきたり、脈絡のないことを言い出したりと、つかみどころがない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"バドミントンの全国区の大会での優勝経験があり、学生プレイヤー達の間では、かなり名前が知られている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"食事量多め。よく食べるので（胸が）よく育った、とは本人談。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"4057","sourceWorkId":"20536","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"親友の詩乃に言わせると “変わった子” で、何を考えているかイマイチ分からない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"突然顔を近づけてきたり、脈絡のないことを言い出したりと、掴み所がない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"バドミントンの全国区の大会で優勝経験があり、学生プレーヤーたちの間ではかなり名前が知られている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"食事量多め。 よく食べるので （胸が） よく育った、とは本人談。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「べつに努力してたわけじゃない。 好きなことを一生懸命やってただけ。」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"26227"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/93/930a4934019a5f8fc4753e9f20f43c1638f51792c627ef5b7ef8bdc583fbe3a7.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/dd/ddd6f28b40bcacb4ec4c8b881f9c0fc4f22698cdbb89efb1e16be53cb8b0b78c.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"葵ゆり","creatorId":"vndb:s1748","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1748","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1748","name":"葵 ゆり","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:105787:26227:20638:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c21366","characterName":"古川 漣","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"26228","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"105787"}],"egsCharacterIds":["4058"],"vndbCharacterId":"c21366"},"originalCharacterName":"古川 漣","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The girl that gave the clock to the protagonist. Free spirited and mischievous, and has a strong curiosity. While she obviously is a hospitalized patient that needs to convalesce, but she still has a very positive attitude. She has experienced countless numbers of traveling back in time, so she has been living for several decades by now. With the experience she has gained, she understood the concept of the future that cannot be changed. She has been separated from the protagonist for over 5 years now, but the protagonist believes that she is still alive."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c21366"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"陸に『時計』を渡した張本人。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"自由奔放でいたずら好き、そして好奇心旺盛。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"安静にしていなければならない入院患者なのに、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"妙にアグレッシブ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"何度も時間を巻き戻し、体感として何十年以上も生きているが、だからこそ「未来を変えることはできない」という認識を持っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"別れて５年が経った現在、陸はその生死を知らない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しかし今でもその存在は、心の中に強く残り続けている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"胸は自分で笑い飛ばすくらいちっちゃい。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"4058","sourceWorkId":"20536","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"陸に “時計” を渡した張本人。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"自由奔放でいたずら好き、そして好奇心旺盛。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"安静にしていなければならない入院患者なのに、妙にアグレッシブ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"何度も時間を巻き戻し、体感として何十年以上も生きているが、だからこそ “未来を変えることはできない” という認識を持っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"別れて 5年が経った現在、陸はその生死を知らない。 しかし今でもその存在は、心の中に強く残り続けている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"胸は自分で笑い飛ばすくらいちっちゃい。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「未来、変えられるように―― 頑張ってごらん。」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"26228"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ee/eeef23adafa8e807b702f477fc7845c8958a8a874236c460f6462ac3e669a47f.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/termina